      "alt": "Starterkit STKa8Xx4",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A35 based on i.MX8X</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa8Xx4 is an evaluation kit designed for embedded computing engineers. It's based on the TQMa8Xx4 platform, featuring the Arm Cortex-A35 processor from NXP's i.MX8X series. This kit is well-suited for applications requiring high-quality graphics with 4K support. It comes with integrated security functions and a Cortex-M4 CPU for real-time and security applications. The kit boasts low power consumption, typically around 4 watts, making it energy-efficient. Additionally, it features a DSP for audio processing and offers 3x CAN-FD for versatile connectivity.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 00:01:20 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
